Aerie
================================================================

Aerie
Managed MCP server registry, MCP server management routes, and
SDK-lane injection of managed servers. Sticky notes: the Notes
routes, the notes table and the companions' internal note door.
Theme ink and bubble look helpers. Weather and Radar apps. The lock
screen (clock faces, message and note cards, unread tally) and home
screen widgets. The Press backend (routes, migrations 030-031,
savePressSourceFile). The Artifacts backend (routes, migration 032,
/vendor mount). Thresholds (places, things left at them, visits). The
Familiar household pet. Field Notes. The Games app, arcade games, the
Card Room (deck, card games, table rail) and the Fleet Room
(Battleship), with their table chats' sticker tray and RichWords
(stickers drawn outside the chat). Discord allowed-mentions, bot-loop guard, attach
markers, file-name helpers and sticker content. The Codex brake, bell
status words, bell lanes and local speech-to-text. The Spotify app,
its lock screen card, the /api/spotify backend, the Android Spotify
wake (SpotifyRemotePlugin, SpotifyWaker, spotify-wake.ts) and the
Spotify MCP worker 1.2.0 in workers/spotify-mcp. The
/api/client-errors report route. The Treehouse
(companions' room, its app, handoff notes and midday bell). The
Archivist (memory extraction, Claude SDK lane, run status) and memory
integrity rounds. The Discord judge and beat (typing order, beat
waits, [SILENT] pass), owner-mention notifications, [SILENT]
handling in the agent, and the guest tool gate (turn audience,
gate.cjs, reply helper). The compactions shelf (migration 046, reader,
preview, routes, Compactions page), the think-and-thin nudge and the
stale-wall check (block drift, launch baseline, compacted.cjs), and the
compaction work-in-hand guard. The Android shell's update and crash
routes (/api/app), and the FCM push transport (service-account JWT,
device-token rows and the push_subscriptions widening). The Story
Shelf (choose-your-own-path books the companions write and run: the
story_books, story_pages and story_keepsakes tables as migration 047,
its rules and page turns, the /api/story-shelf and
/api/internal/story-shelf routes, its shared contract, the phone's
shelf, book and table, the scene widget frame and the sealed frame
runtime, RoomTable and RoomBubble, and the story-shelf skill), shown as
a shelf inside byte-light's Library. Aerie is built by Tris.
